
---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="The Dream Eater’s Bargain | Patrick O’Dell">

  <section class="book-page">
    <div class="container">

      <img class="cover" src="/the-dream-eaters-bargain-cover.jpg" alt="The Dream Eater’s Bargain cover" />

      <h1>The Dream Eater’s Bargain</h1>

      <p class="blurb">
        Elias Fetch’s power is fading, and something older than understanding takes notice.

        When Somnus appears without warning, he offers a bargain that binds Elias to a hunt through the Dream Realm itself.

        What begins as a search for escaped Dream Lords becomes something far more unstable — where memory, identity, and consequence begin to collapse into one another.
      </p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="YOUR-PREORDER-LINK">Preorder</a>
        <a class="btn secondary" href="/books">Back to Books</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>

.book-page {
  padding: 80px 20px;
  text-align: center;
}

.container {
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.cover {
  width: 240px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.blurb {
  text-align: left;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  justify-content: center;
}

.btn {
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.primary {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
  color: black;
}

.secondary {
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
}

</style>
